# Context Artifacts

## Goal

Keep short-lived execution memory in explicit runtime artifacts instead of scattering it across chat turns.

## Recommended local runtime files

- `.ai/context/current.md`
- `.ai/context/runtime/plan.md`
- `.ai/context/runtime/progress.md`

## `current.md`

Use as a short digest only:

- active scope
- touched files
- adjacent surfaces
- current step
- latest verify evidence

Do not dump large research or full code excerpts into `current.md`.

## Runtime mirrors

If tracker-backed `PLAN::` / `PROGRESS::` artifacts are unavailable, mirror them locally:

- `.ai/context/runtime/plan.md`
- `.ai/context/runtime/progress.md`

These mirrors should keep the same structure as the tracker artifacts.
